1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,600
Reading task An April Fool's Joke

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:13,220
The Noodle Harvest A fool sees not the same tree that a wise

3
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,240
man sees.

4
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:22,060
William Blake April Fool's Day, or April the 1st, is known

5
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,780
in many countries as a day for playing jokes on others.

6
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:30,680
It is usually a time when children make fun of each other,

7
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:34,580
but sometimes other people can get caught in the fun too.

8
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:42,100
One of the most famous jokes in England took place on British television in 1957.

9
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,180
One of them was called Panorama,

10
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:57,540
This show explored problems and progress all over the world,

11
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:04,200
so nobody was surprised when it began with a report on the excellent noodle harvest in south Switzerland.

12
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:23,000
The reporter showed many noodle trees with the farmers pulling noodles off them

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,620
and putting them into baskets.

14
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:30,780
The people watching were told that they may not have heard of noodles from this part of the world

15
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:34,520
because noodles were grown as part of small family businesses.

16
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:03,940
The last two weeks of March are an anxious time for noodle farmers.

17
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:08,760
There is always a chance of very cold weather spoiling their crop.

18
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:22,700
They rang the BBC to find out how to grow their own noodle tree.

19
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:48,100
So it seemed possible to imagine that noodles grew on trees like apples,

20
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,460
pears and nuts.

21
00:02:57,480 --> 00:03:03,440
So they were shocked to find the next day that they had all believed an April Fool’s joke.

22
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:11,540
Even today the report of the noodle harvest is remembered as one of the best April Fool’s jokes ever!
